<title>SRI LANKA: Colombo Dockyard up on retail buying.</title>
<headline>Colombo Dockyard up on retail buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Colombo Dockyard Ltd rose four percent or one rupee to 26, in early Wednesday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The share which is cheap, liquid and expected to see good growth in 1997, is favoured by small retail investors,&quot; said a broker who decliend to be identified.</p>
<p>The company builds ships and carries out repairs for local and international clients.</p>
<p>--- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
